OL,3,GNEWSAPeople sacrificed for warehouses,
OL,4,Asays councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents feel they are "being
OL,7,Fsacrificed" so warehouses which
OL,8,Fdevelopers believe could create 3,500
OL,9,Fjobs can be built on a business park,
OL,10,Faccording to a councillor.
OL,12,FProperty firm Curzon De Vere has been
OL,13,Fgranted permission to build 16 small
OL,14,Fwarehouses on 32 hectares of land at
OL,15,FPort One Logistics Park, in Great
OL,16,FBlakenham, near Ipswich.
OL,18,FDuring a Mid Suffolk District Council
OL,19,Fplanning meeting last week, Rachael
OL,20,FDickson, on behalf of the proper
OL,21,Fdeveloper, said the project would bring
OL,22,F"significant benefits for the area".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
