OL,3,GNEWSAPeople sacrificed for warehouses,
OL,4,Asays councillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Jonathan Svendsen-Cook, of Little
OL,7,FBlakenham Parish Council, said
OL,8,Fresidents had objected to and raised
OL,9,Fconcerns about the plans.
